<title>ITALY: Italian Dec industrial output down 3.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italian Dec industrial output down 3.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Statistics Institute ISTAT gave the following provisional figures for industrial production, year-on-year, in December.</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION		Dec 96   Nov 96   Dec 95</p>
<p> Production index (unadjusted)	93.6    108.1(r)  96.6</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct change (unadjusted)	-3.1     -6.4(r)  -2.7</p>
<p> Mnth/mnth pct change (adjusted)    -2.2     +0.4(r)  +3.8</p>
<p> Working days in month		    20	20	 18</p>
<p>Note: (The industrial production index was rebased in January 1994 on 1990 levels, replacing a 1985-based index.)</p>
</text>
